WEBVTT

38:00.853 --> 38:04.272
-This is ludicrous.
-Hey, bozo, you got a brain in there?

38:05.483 --> 38:06.775
Take that!

38:08.069 --> 38:10.153
Oh, no! Sid!

38:10.571 --> 38:11.821
Get down!

38:14.200 --> 38:15.492
What's gotten into you? I was...

38:15.576 --> 38:17.744
You are the one that decided
to climb into this...

38:17.828 --> 38:20.246
The claw, it moves.

38:25.753 --> 38:27.087
I have been chosen!

38:27.838 --> 38:30.799
Farewell, my friends.
I go on to a better place.
